<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<style>
@page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
html, body { margin: 0; padding: 0; }
{{ css|safe }}
.back {
  width: 210mm; height: 296.5mm; overflow: hidden; position: relative;
  background: #F5F0E4; color: var(--ink);
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
}
.frame { position: absolute; inset: 7mm; border: 1.2pt solid #A89B7E; }
.frame-inner { position: absolute; inset: 9.5mm; border: 0.5pt solid #C9BC9F; }
.back-inner { position: relative; text-align: center; max-width: 162mm; }
.back h1 { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 30pt; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 5pt; color: #37322A; }
.back .sub { font-family: var(--serif); color: #7A6A4C; font-size: 11.5pt; letter-spacing: 2.5pt; margin-top: 5mm; }
.back .seal {
  display: inline-block; background: #9C3B2C; color: #FCF9F1; font-family: var(--serif);
  font-weight: 700; font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 2pt; padding: 2.2mm 3mm;
  border-radius: 1.5mm; margin-top: 7mm;
}
.roles { display: flex; gap: 6mm; margin-top: 9mm; }
.roles .r {
  flex: 1; background: #FCF9F1; border: 1px solid #E3DAC5; border-top: 2.2pt solid #9C3B2C;
  border-radius: 6pt; padding: 7pt 4pt 6pt;
}
.roles .duty { font-size: 8.2pt; color: #8F8674; }
.roles .name {
  font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 700; color: #37322A; font-size: 9.8pt;
  margin-top: 1.5pt; text-wrap: balance;
}
.back .line1 { color: #37322A; font-size: 9.4pt; margin-top: 8mm; letter-spacing: .5pt; }
.back .line2 { color: #8F8674; font-size: 8.8pt; margin-top: 2.5mm; }
.back .fine { color: #8F8674; font-size: 8.2pt; margin-top: 7mm; line-height: 1.95; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="back">
  <div class="frame"></div>
  <div class="frame-inner"></div>
  <div class="back-inner">
    <h1>{{ back.title }}</h1>
    <div class="sub">{{ back.sub }}</div>
    <div class="seal">平安</div>
    <div class="roles">
      {% for duty, name in back.roles %}
      <div class="r"><div class="duty">{{ duty }}</div><div class="name">{{ name }}</div></div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div class="line1">{{ back.line1 }}</div>
    <div class="line2">{{ back.line2 }}</div>
    <div class="fine">
      本路书由 TripMate 多 Agent 协同旅游规划系统自动汇编，仅供出行参考<br>
      车票 / 酒店 / 门票请在官方渠道完成预订与支付（系统不接触支付）<br>
      天气、路线与价格为生成时点数据，出行前请再次核实
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
